title: '? The four questions put the threshold in the right place.'
pid: 3519ca14-2b30-437f-8fa3-b366d7e1e84b
body: |2-
  Trial: for the next five requests, Top writes which of the four
  each answered yes to. Afterwards, a planless request that needed
  rework, or a plan that changed nothing a builder would have done,
  moves the line.
